rface":"செச்சை","parts":[{"text":"செச்சை","lemma":"செச்சை","gloss":"red goat"}],"gloss":"red goat"},{"surface":"போல","parts":[{"text":"போல","lemma":"போல","gloss":"like"}],"gloss":"like"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"தன்னோர்","parts":[{"text":"தன்","lemma":"தன்","gloss":"his"},{"text":"ஓர்","lemma":"ஓர்","gloss":"peers/equals"}],"gloss":"his peers"},{"surface":"அன்ன","parts":[{"text":"அன்ன","lemma":"அன்ன","gloss":"like"}],"gloss":"like"},{"surface":"இளையர்","parts":[{"text":"இளையர்","lemma":"இளையர்","gloss":"young men"}],"gloss":"young men"},{"surface":"இருப்ப","parts":[{"text":"இரு","lemma":"இரு","gloss":"to be/remain"},{"text":"ப்ப","lemma":"ப்ப","gloss":"while"}],"gloss":"while they remain"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"பலர்மீது","parts":[{"text":"பலர்","lemma":"பலர்","gloss":"many people"},{"text":"மீது","lemma":"மீது","gloss":"upon/towards"}],"gloss":"towards many"},{"surface":"நீட்டிய","parts":[{"text":"நீட்டு","lemma":"நீட்டு","gloss":"stretch out"},{"text":"இய","lemma":"இய","gloss":"adjectival participle suffix"}],"gloss":"who stretched out"},{"surface":"மண்டை","parts":[{"text":"மண்டை","lemma":"மண்டை","gloss":"eating bowl/begging bowl"}],"gloss":"eating bowl"},{"surface":"என்","parts":[{"text":"என்","lemma":"என்","gloss":"my"}],"gloss":"my"},{"surface":"சிறுவனை","parts":[{"text":"சிறுவன்","lemma":"சிறுவன்","gloss":"young son"},{"text":"ஐ","lemma":"ஐ","gloss":"accusative case marker"}],"gloss":"young son"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"கால்வழி","parts":[{"text":"கால்","lemma":"கால்","gloss":"foot"},{"text":"வழி","lemma":"வழி","gloss":"way/direction"}],"gloss":"at the foot-end"},{"surface":"கட்டிலில்","parts":[{"text":"கட்டில்","lemma":"கட்டில்","gloss":"bed/cot"},{"text":"இல்","lemma":"இல்","gloss":"locative case marker"}],"gloss":"on the bed"},{"surface":"கிடப்பி","parts":[{"text":"கிட","lemma":"கிட","gloss":"lie down"},{"text":"ப்பி","lemma":"ப்பி","gloss":"causative verbal participle suffix"}],"gloss":"having laid down"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"தூவெள்","parts":[{"text":"தூ","lemma":"தூ","gloss":"pure"},{"text":"வெள்","lemma":"வெள்","gloss":"white"}],"gloss":"pure white"},{"surface":"அறுவை","parts":[{"text":"அறுவை","lemma":"அறுவை","gloss":"cloth/shroud"}],"gloss":"shroud"},{"surface":"போர்ப்பித்து","parts":[{"text":"போர்","lemma":"போர்","gloss":"cover"},{"text":"ப்பித்து","lemma":"ப்பித்து","gloss":"causative verbal participle suffix"}],"gloss":"having covered"},{"surface":"இலதே","parts":[{"text":"இலது","lemma":"இல்","gloss":"did not"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ஏ","gloss":"emphasis"}],"gloss":"did not indeed"}]}],"literal":"Like a red goat among white sheep / while young men like him remain / my young son who stretched out his eating bowl to many / laying him on a bed with his feet aligned / they did not cover him with a pure white shroud!","translation":"Like a single red goat standing out among white sheep, while other young men like him still remain alive, my young boy—who used to stretch out his bowl to many—has not been laid out on a funeral bed with his feet aligned, nor has he been covered with a pure white shroud.","modern":"வெள்ளை ஆடுகளுக்கு இடையே உள்ள சிவப்பு ஆட்டைப் போல, தன்னை ஒத்த மற்ற இளைஞர்கள் உயிரோடு இருக்க, பலரிடமும் தன் உணவுக் கலத்தை நீட்டி இரந்துண்ட என் சிறு மகனை, கால்களை நேரே நீட்டிப் படுக்கையில் கிடத்தி, தூய வெள்ளை ஆடையால் போர்த்தவில்லையே!","explanation":"This poem is a poignant lament by a mother mourning the heroic death of her young son on the battlefield. The mother contrasts her son's unique bravery with his peers, comparing him to a single red goat standing out among a flock of white sheep. She remembers him as a young boy who used to stretch out his bowl to others, highlighting his innocence and youth. Instead of receiving a peaceful domestic funeral where he would be laid on a bed with his feet aligned and covered in a pure white shroud, he lies gloriously but tragically on the battlefield. This belongs to the karantai tiṇai, which celebrates the courage of young warriors who die defending their community's cattle and honor.","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"},"timing":{"male":[[0.0,0.5],[0.5,0.96],[0.96,1.35],[1.5,1.7],[1.7,2.3],[2.3,2.7],[2.7,2.7],[2.7,3.63],[3.79,4.3],[4.3,4.8],[4.8,5.4],[5.4,5.89],[5.89,6.4],[6.4,6.8],[6.8,8.68],[8.68,8.68],[8.68,8.68],[8.68,8.68],[8.68,9.3]],"female":[[0.0,0.6],[0.6,1.1],[1.1,1.4],[1.4,1.6],[1.6,2.6],[2.6,2.9],[2.9,3.0],[3.0,4.07],[4.24,4.7],[4.7,5.4],[5.4,6.0],[6.0,6.51],[6.51,7.2],[7.2,7.7],[7.7,9.57],[9.57,9.57],[9.57,9.57],[9.57,9.57],[9.57,10.2]]},"sync":[[["வெள்ளை","white"]],[["வெள்யாட்டு","of the white sheep"],["செச்சை","red goat"]],[["செச்சை","red goat"]],[["போல","like"]],[["தன்னோர்","his peers"]],[["அன்ன","like"]],[["இளையர்","young men"]],[["இருப்ப","while they remain"]],[["பலர்மீது","towards many"]],[["நீட்டிய","who stretched out"]],[["மண்டை","eating bowl"],["என்","my"]],[["சிறுவனை","young son"]],[["கால்வழி","at the foot-end"]],[["கட்டிலில்","on the bed"]],[["கிடப்பி","having laid down"]],[["தூவெள்","pure white"]],[["அறுவை","shroud"]],[["போர்ப்பித்து","having covered"]],[["போர்ப்பித்து","having covered"],["இலதே","did not indeed"]]]}